### Goal Model Decomposition

#### Goals

| Name | Text | Runtime | Goal Type | Target Condition | Relation |
|------|------|---------|-----------|------------------|----------|
| **G1** | Fulfill Resource Request | - | Achieve | The requested resources are collected and delivered to the specified location. | - |
| **G2** | Collect Resources | - | Achieve | All requested resources are collected from their respective storage locations. | AND |
| **G2.1** | Identify Storage Locations | - | Achieve | The storage locations for the requested resources are identified. | AND |
| **G2.2** | Plan Collection Path | - | Achieve | A path is planned to collect resources from identified storage locations. | AND |
| **G2.3** | Request Resources | - | Achieve | The robot requests the specified resources from the storage. | AND |
| **G2.4** | Handle Low Battery in Collection | - | Perform | Return to the recharging station and assign the mission to another robot. | AND |
| **G3** | Deliver Resources | - | Achieve | All collected resources are delivered to the specified location. | AND |
| **G3.1** | Plan Delivery Route | - | Achieve | A delivery route is planned to transport resources to the specified location. | AND |
| **G3.2** | Transport Resources | - | Achieve | The resources are transported to the specified location. | AND |
| **G3.3** | Handle Low Battery in Delivery | - | Perform | Return to a checkpoint, assign the remaining task to another robot, and ensure the resource is positioned correctly. | AND |

#### Tasks

| Name | Text | Relation | Location | Number of Robots |
|------|------|----------|-----------|-------------------|
| **AT1** | Identify Storage Locations | AND | Hospital, Laundry, Sterile Facilities | 1 |
| **AT2** | Plan Collection Path | AND | Hospital, Laundry, Sterile Facilities | 1 |
| **AT3** | Request Resources | AND | Storage Locations | 1 |
| **AT4** | Return to Recharging Station | AND | Recharging Station | 1 |
| **AT5** | Plan Delivery Route | AND | Hospital, Laundry, Sterile Facilities | 1 |
| **AT6** | Transport Resources | AND | Hospital, Laundry, Sterile Facilities | 1 |
| **AT7** | Return to Checkpoint | AND | Checkpoint | 1 |

### Logical Relationships

- **G1 -> G2, G3 [AND]**
- **G2 -> G2.1, G2.2, G2.3, G2.4 [AND]**
- **G3 -> G3.1, G3.2, G3.3 [AND]**
- **G2.4 -> AT4 [AND]**
- **G3.3 -> AT7 [AND]**

This goal model represents the hierarchical decomposition of the mission into achievable goals and actionable tasks, ensuring that all constraints and requirements are met.
